{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25902","headline":"和太原张相公山亭怀古 · 崔公信","name":"和太原张相公山亭怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"叠石状崖巘，翠含城上楼。\n前移庐霍峰，远带沅湘流。\n潇洒主人静，夤缘芳径幽。\n清辉在昏旦，岂异东山游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔公信","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}